WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 3-07 - Upon This Winter's Night
NOTE Artist: The Arctic Symphony Project
NOTE Album: 2007: Tales from the Solstice
NOTE Language: en-US

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.500
The clock upon the mantel chimes

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.000
Reminding me of better times

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.500
The window pane is frosted white

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:40.000
I'm searching for a sign tonight

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.500
I know the storm is raging on

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.000
I know the daylight's dead and gone

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.500
But in this house, the fire burns

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:58.500
Until the traveler returns

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.500
Can you hear me calling?

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:09.000
Can you see the glow?

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.500
Through the miles of silence

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:18.000
And the drifting snow?

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.500
So keep a candle burning bright

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:28.000
Upon this winter's night

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.500
Though you've wandered far and wide

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:37.000
Time remains upon your side

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.500
Follow the star, follow the light

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:48.000
And make it home tonight

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:10.500
The world is cold and full of fear

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:15.000
But sanctuary waits in here

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.500
Don't let the shadows steal your way

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:24.000
Don't listen to the words they say

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.500
The journey's hard, the road is steep

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:33.000
But promises are yours to keep

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:37.500
So lift your head and face the wind

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:42.500
And let the journey home begin

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:48.500
So keep a candle burning bright

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:53.000
Upon this winter's night

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:57.500
Though you've wandered far and wide

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:02.000
Time remains upon your side

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:06.500
Follow the star, follow the light

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:12.000
And make it home tonight

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:18.000
I'm sending out a prayer! (Bring him home! Bring him home!)

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:23.000
To vanish all despair! (You are not alone!)

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:27.500
No matter where you are, no matter how far!

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:33.000
Just look to the Northern Star!

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:56.500
So keep a candle burning bright

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:01.000
Upon this winter's night

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:05.500
Though you've wandered far and wide

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:10.000
Time remains upon your side

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:14.500
Follow the star, follow the light

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:20.000
And make it home tonight

